00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:17.250
who create, Kubernetes these
environments on premise.

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.664
This also can be extended out.

00:15:18.664 --> 00:15:20.580
Developers could create
and destroy their own.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:23.310
Your scripting, your automation
