00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:57.902
Holey socks.

00:16:57.902 --> 00:16:58.610
What do we have ?

00:16:58.610 --> 00:16:59.735
We have lots of socks here.

00:16:59.735 --> 00:17:03.190
Super socks, color socks,
cross socks, et cetera.

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:06.359
So this is an application
