Who deployed it,
when did they deploy

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:50.790
it, how much is it
costing them, what's

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.260
the health of all the
different components?

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:56.040
Things like can I add
more, can I scale them?

00:19:56.040 --> 00:20:02.070
All of this can be done via user
interface, via command line,

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:03.720
or via APIs.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:07.240
So for example, App Dynamics
or the other APM system

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:09.520
you use of choice may be
monitoring this application

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:12.480
now, looking at the health
in the user experience.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:16.470
And would that application need
to be written to go and find

00:20:16.470 --> 00:20:19.234
the innovation guys
know their YAML file

00:20:19.234 --> 00:20:21.150
and know how to scale
and add additional nodes

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:24.990
if the middleware tier is slow,
or if the store itself, the web

