works, the platform

00:23:52.255 --> 00:23:54.380
just gives you production
grade and still gives you

00:23:54.380 --> 00:23:55.860
Kubernetes access to it.

00:23:55.860 --> 00:23:58.010
So all the open source
API software and tools

00:23:58.010 --> 00:24:00.560
